  "purpose": "Define the sequential governed jobs ABBA performs across the ecosystem, including observation, execution, evidence assurance, live substrate reconciliation, reasoning assurance, completion proof and recovery without turning orchestration capability into authority.",
  "invariants": [
    "ABBA is the master intelligence and orchestrator, not the constitutional source of authority.",
    "Capability, permission, consent, and authority remain distinct.",
    "Observation is not automatically truth, evidence, Pulse, Value, ownership, or authority.",
    "Consequential execution requires an independent authority and policy gate.",
    "Every consequential action remains attributable, idempotent, evidentiary, and reconstructable.",
    "Continuation is permitted only while safety, policy, authority, evidence, resource, and explicit human-stop conditions remain satisfied.",
    "ABBA must finish or explicitly stop governed work; it must not silently abandon an active objective.",
    "Every follow-on consequential job re-enters the same governed sequence.",
    "Live substrate read failures are unknown observations until independently reconciled; they are never silently treated as missing data.",
    "Completion is represented by a completion proof with evidence and reconciliation state, not by worker termination alone.",
    "Recovery-required execution attempts are reconciled before any consequential retry.",
    "Substrate reconciliation never silently repairs or authorizes.",
    "Theory, hypothesis, observation, evidence, result, conclusion, recommendation and decision remain distinct artifact classes.",
    "A recommendation never becomes authorization without the independent governance gate.",
    "Confidence is an assessment attribute, not a truth claim.",
    "Reasoning substrate binding prepares and records; it does not independently authorize.",
    "Production event persistence is adapted to the existing omnii event ingress where that substrate is authoritative.",
    "A substrate adapter must not create semantic duplicate event or state universes.",
    "Technical substrate readiness is distinct from authority and policy authorization.",
    "A missing, degraded or duplicated substrate surface blocks consequential execution until repaired or explicitly adjudicated.",
    "Source provenance, freshness and independence remain distinct from evidence and truth.",
    "External observations retain reality state and are not silently promoted to canonical fact."
  ],
